    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Property Team Lappin Estates are delighted to present this wonderful three-bedroom, west facing, semi-detached family home. Perfectly positioned in an extremely sought-after residential enclave just off Collins Avenue, this property boasts a highly desirable west-facing rear garden—ideal for enjoying warm, sunny afternoons and evenings.\r\nThe location offers an unparalleled lifestyle of convenience, with an abundance of local amenities right on your doorstep.\r\n•\tShopping & Retail: Moments from Omni Park Shopping Centre, Gullivers Retail Park, and IKEA, offering every retail outlet, café, and cinema experience imaginable.\r\n•\tEducation: A short, convenient stroll to Dublin City University (DCU), with an excellent selection of primary and secondary schools nearby.\r\n•\tLeisure: Surrounded by a variety of parklands, sporting clubs, and recreational facilities perfect for growing families.\r\n•\tConnectivity: Exceptional transport links providing effortless access to the M1, M50, and Dublin Airport, making commuting a breeze.\r\nThis property represents a rare opportunity to acquire a beautiful family home in a premier neighbourhood. Viewing comes very highly recommended to truly appreciate everything this property and location have to offer.\r\nContact Property Team Lappin Estates today to arrange a viewing!!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Porch\t\t\r\nEntrance Hall\t\tStorage press.  Solid wood flooring and alarm control panel\r\nLiving Room 1)\t3.90m x 3.20m\tWooden flooring and door to:\r\nLiving Room 2)\t4.90m x 3.30m\tWooden flooring, open fireplace with electric fire insert.  Double doors to garden.\r\nKitchen\t4.00m x 2.50m\tFitted wall and floor kitchen units, washing machine, integrated fridge freezer and free-standing cooker.  Tiled floor, under stairs storage, door to west facing rear garden.\r\nLanding\t3.80m x 2.10m\tPull down stira to attic.  Shelved hot press.\r\nBathroom\t\tShower, WC, whb, fully tiled walls and floor\r\nBedroom 1)\t3.80m x 3.60m\tDouble room\r\nBedroom 2)\t4.10m x 3.00m\tDouble room\r\nBedroom 3)\t2.70m x 2.40m\tLarge single room\r\n\r\nOutside\t\tTo the front there is a cobble lock driveway with side pedestrian access to the west facing rear garden with a concrete shed. The walled back garden is c. 14m long and mainy laid in lawn."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
